event-loop is manage task microtask Queue and Task Queue which is preffered on Work.

call-satck is single threading work async and sync to mange task and then excute code.

for-example

console.log("Start");

setTimeout(() => {
    console.log("Timeout");
}, 0);

Promise.resolve().then(() => {
    console.log("Promise");
});

console.log("End");

// output:-
start , End , Promise , Timeout

Becuase start and End sync work and Promise microtask queue then Queue and last Timeout Queue task.

// golden rules:-
When call back finshes , javascript process pending microtask before excute the next timer callback